            StyleBox["basis", "TI", FontFamily -> "Times", FontSlant -> 
              "Italic"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], " \[LineSeparator]", "comp\
utes reciprocal lattice basis vectors from a two- or three-dimensional \
